  "question": {
    "text": "The product of all the values of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, such that the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> cannot form a triangle, is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1.8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Case I: <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are parallel<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>λ</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Case II: <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are parallel<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Case III: Lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are concurrent<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn></math><br />Hence, the product of all the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>λ</mi></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.8</mn></math>"
  }
